(4. SICK LEAVE) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4.1 Employees receive 12 days of paid sick leave per calendar year.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4.2 An employee who is unwell must inform their manager before 10:00 a.m. on the first day of) Tj
T* (absence.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4.3 A medical certificate from a registered medical practitioner is required for any sick leave) Tj
T* (longer than 3 consecutive days.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4.4 Unused sick leave does not carry over to the next calendar year and is not paid out when) Tj
T* (employment ends.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5. REMOTE WORK) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5.1 Employees become eligible for remote work after completing their 90-day probation period.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5.2 Eligible employees may work remotely for up to 2 days per week. The remote days must be) Tj
T* (agreed with the employee's manager in advance.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5.3 While working remotely, employees must be reachable during core working hours and must use) Tj
T* (the Company VPN for all work systems.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5.4 The Company provides a laptop and pays an internet allowance of INR 1,500 per month to) Tj
T* (employees who work remotely at least one day per week.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5.5 Fully remote arrangements are an exception. They require approval from the Vice President) Tj
T* (of the employee's division and are reviewed every 6 months.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (6. BEREAVEMENT LEAVE) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (6.1 Employees may take up to 3 days of paid bereavement leave after the death of an immediate) Tj
T* (family member. Immediate family means a spouse, child, parent or sibling.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (7. PUBLIC HOLIDAYS) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (7.1 The Company observes 10 paid public holidays each year. The list of public holidays for the) Tj
T* (next year is published by HR every December.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (8. EQUIPMENT AND INFORMATION SECURITY) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (8.1 Company laptops must be locked whenever they are left unattended.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (8.2 Passwords for Company systems must be changed every 90 days and must not be shared with) Tj
T* (anyone, including colleagues and managers.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (8.3 Lost or stolen equipment must be reported to the IT helpdesk within 24 hours.) Tj
T* () Tj
ET
endstream
